newton         on
boundary       p p f

read_data      /projects/westgroup/akinyemi.az/mace_lammps/MHI_Nickel/tests/pipeline/work/diffusivity/neb_subsurface/ni_bulk_test/hopa/s_1/sub1_fs_raw.lammps
